{
    "title": "Cosmo Run",
    "description": "Cosmo Run is inspired by the classic game Snake, but instead it puts the player in an immersive 3D environment where the challenge is to perform skillful turns in all directions.\r\n\r\nSurvive long enough and you will meet special alternative paths - both hardcore and rewarding. Are you worthy to command the Cosmo?\r\n\r\nLocal multiplayer is available on AndroidTV and tablets.\r\nAvailable on Wear OS\r\n\r\nCosmo is the pure energy that binds us all.\r\nIt is the purpose that created us and all around us.\r\nIt is an illusion, deceiving and out of control.\r\nIt is here because of you and your ability of survival.\r\nIn this projection of reality you need to strive to immortality.\r\n\r\n\r\nGet in touch with us and follow the latest news:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/nosixfive\r\nhttps://twitter.com/nosixfive",
    "descriptionHTML": "Cosmo Run is inspired by the classic game Snake, but instead it puts the player in an immersive 3D environment where the challenge is to perform skillful turns in all directions.<br><br>Survive long enough and you will meet special alternative paths - both hardcore and rewarding. Are you worthy to command the Cosmo?<br><br>Local multiplayer is available on AndroidTV and tablets.<br>Available on Wear OS<br><br>Cosmo is the pure energy that binds us all.<br>It is the purpose that created us and all around us.<br>It is an illusion, deceiving and out of control.<br>It is here because of you and your ability of survival.<br>In this projection of reality you need to strive to immortality.<br><br><br>Get in touch with us and follow the latest news:<br>https://www.facebook.com/nosixfive<br>https://twitter.com/nosixfive",
